#. module: l10n_ca_mb_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_mb_payroll.source_levy_act
msgid ""
"Levy of 2.15% of the remuneration paid in each month; no levy for a total "
"remuneration of the year of 2,500,000 or less; 4.3% of the excess over "
"2,500,000 for a total of more than 2,500,000 and not more than 5,000,000. "
"Associated corporations compute as a single employer and share the exemption"
" or notch reduction."
msgstr ""

